        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E19_Physical_Object"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Raw materials used in mining and metallurgy activities, including natural ores, preliminarily smelted metal ingots, fluxes, and fuels. These raw materials are the fundamental material conditions of mining and metallurgy production. Examples: ores, recycled materials, fluxes, fuels.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">矿冶生产所需的原料，包括矿石、燃料、助熔剂等。</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ore and Smelting Materials</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">矿冶原料</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


