    </rdf:Description>
    <rdf:Description>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#AllDisjointClasses"/>
        <owl:members rdf:parseType="Collection">
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#CopperSmelting"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Cupellation"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Gold_Panning_and_Smelting"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#IronSmelting"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Mercury_Smelting"/>
            <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Steelmaking"/>
        </owl:members>
    </rdf:Description>
<owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#consistsOfComponent"><rdfs:subPropertyOf rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/P46i_forms_part_of"/><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">包含组件</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">consists of component</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">器物组合件所包含的组件器物，建立组合件与单件器物之间的包含关系（Domain=mmho:ArtifactAssemblage, Range=mmho:FinalProducts, subPropertyOf crm:P46i_forms_part_of）。用于 ABox 数据填充时连接具体组合件实例与其组件。</rdfs:comment><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#ArtifactAssemblage"/><rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#FinalProducts"/></owl:ObjectProperty><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#YongZhong"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">甬钟</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yong Bell</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">钟的一种，因钟体呈圆筒形（"甬"为圆筒之意）而得名，是西周中期以后编钟组合中的主要低音钟。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#FinalProducts"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#NiuZhong"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">钮钟</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Niu Bell</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">钟的一种，因钟体上部有长柄（"钮"）而得名，多用于编钟组合中的高音区。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#FinalProducts"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:ObjectProperty rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#hasBroaderPeriod"><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#TransitiveProperty"/><rdfs:domain rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">拥有上位时期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">has broader period</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">时序概念的上位时期，用于构建朝代分类层次（Domain=Range=mmho:Period 自指，Transitive 传递）。与 mmho:hasBroaderTerm 区分：后者用于 mmho:Type 子类层级（Domain=Range=mmho:Type），本属性专用于 mmho:Period 层级。</rdfs:comment></owl:ObjectProperty><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Xia"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">夏代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Xia Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 2070-前 1600 年，中国第一个世袭制朝代。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Shang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">商代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shang Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1600-前 1046 年，中国第一个有直接文字记载的朝代。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Zhou"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">周代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Zhou Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1046-前 256 年，分西周和东周两个时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Qin"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">秦代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Qin Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 221-前 207 年，中国第一个大一统中央集权制朝代。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Han"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">汉代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Han Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 202-公元 220 年，分西汉和东汉两个时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#ThreeKingdoms"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">三国</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Three Kingdoms</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 220-280 年，魏、蜀、吴三国鼎立时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#JinDynasty"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">晋代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Jin Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 266-420 年，分西晋（266-316）和东晋（317-420）两个时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#WesternJin"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">西晋</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Western Jin</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 266-316 年，结束三国分裂的短期统一王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#JinDynasty"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#EasternJin"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">东晋</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Eastern Jin</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 317-420 年，晋室南渡后的江左王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#JinDynasty"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#SixteenKingdoms"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">十六国</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sixteen Kingdoms</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 304-439 年，与东晋及南北朝并存的北方及西南地区十六个割据政权。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#JinDynasty"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#SouthernNorthernDynasties"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">南北朝</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Southern and Northern Dynasties</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 420-589 年，南朝与北朝并立时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Sui"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">隋代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Sui Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 581-619 年，结束南北朝分裂的短期统一王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Tang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">唐代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Tang Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 618-907 年，中国历史上继汉代之后又一个盛世王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#FiveDynastiesTenKingdoms"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">五代十国</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Five Dynasties and Ten Kingdoms</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 907-979 年，唐朝之后北方五代更替、南方十国并立时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Song"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">宋代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Song Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 960-1279 年，分北宋和南宋两个时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Liao"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">辽代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Liao Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 907-1125 年，由契丹族建立的北方王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#WesternXia"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">西夏</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Western Xia</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 1038-1227 年，由党项族建立的西北王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#JurchenJin"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">金代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Jin Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 1115-1234 年，由女真族建立的北方王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Yuan"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">元代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yuan Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 1271-1368 年，由蒙古族建立的统一王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Ming"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">明代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Ming Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 1368-1644 年，汉族建立的最后一个大一统封建王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Qing"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">清代</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Qing Dynasty</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 1636-1912 年，由满族建立的统一王朝。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#EarlyShang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">商早期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Early Shang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1600-前 1400 年，商代前期，二里岗文化时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Shang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#ErligangLower"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">二里岗下层</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Erligang Lower</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1600-前 1400 年，二里岗文化下层。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#EarlyShang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#ErligangUpper"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">二里岗上层</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Erligang Upper</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1400-前 1300 年，二里岗文化上层。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#EarlyShang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#MiddleShang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">商中期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Middle Shang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1400-前 1300 年，商代中期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Shang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#LateShang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">商晚期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Late Shang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1300-前 1046 年，商代晚期，殷墟文化时期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Shang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#YinxuPhaseI"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">殷墟一期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yinxu Phase I</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1300-前 1250 年，盘庚迁殷至武丁前期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#LateShang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#YinxuPhaseII"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">殷墟二期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yinxu Phase II</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1250-前 1190 年，武丁晚期至祖甲。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#LateShang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#YinxuPhaseIII"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">殷墟三期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yinxu Phase III</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1190-前 1100 年，廪辛、康丁至武乙。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#LateShang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#YinxuPhaseIV"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">殷墟四期</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Yinxu Phase IV</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">约公元前 1100-前 1046 年，文丁至帝辛。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#LateShang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#WesternZhou"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">西周</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Western Zhou</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 1046-前 771 年，周朝前期，定都镐京。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Zhou"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#EasternZhou"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">东周</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Eastern Zhou</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 770-前 256 年，周朝后期，平王东迁洛邑。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Zhou"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#SpringAutumn"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">春秋</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Spring and Autumn Period</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 770-前 476 年，东周前期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#EasternZhou"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#WarringStates"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">战国</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Warring States Period</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 475-前 221 年，东周后期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#EasternZhou"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#WesternHan"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">西汉</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Western Han</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元前 202-公元 9 年，汉朝前期，又称前汉。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Han"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#EasternHan"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">东汉</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Eastern Han</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 25-220 年，汉朝后期，又称后汉。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Han"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Wei"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">魏</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Wei</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 220-265 年，三国时期曹魏政权。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#ThreeKingdoms"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Shu"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">蜀</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Shu</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 221-263 年，三国时期蜀汉政权。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#ThreeKingdoms"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Wu"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">吴</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Wu</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 222-280 年，三国时期东吴政权。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#ThreeKingdoms"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Southern_Dynasties"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">南朝</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Southern Dynasties</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 420-589 年，南方宋、齐、梁、陈四个朝代。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#SouthernNorthernDynasties"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#Northern_Dynasties"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">北朝</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Northern Dynasties</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 386-581 年，北方各朝代总称。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#SouthernNorthernDynasties"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#EarlyTang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">初唐</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Early Tang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 618-713 年，唐朝前期（高祖至睿宗）。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Tang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#HighTang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">盛唐</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">High Tang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 713-766 年，唐朝鼎盛时期（玄宗开元天宝年间）。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Tang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#MiddleTang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">中唐</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Middle Tang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 766-835 年，唐朝中期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Tang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#LateTang"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">晚唐</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Late Tang</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 835-907 年，唐朝后期。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Tang"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#NorthernSong"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">北宋</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Northern Song</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 960-1127 年，宋朝前期，定都汴京。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Song"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#SouthernSong"><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">南宋</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Southern Song</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">公元 1127-1279 年，宋朝南渡之后，定都临安。</rdfs:comment><rdf:type rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Period"/><hasBroaderPeriod rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#Song"/></owl:NamedIndividual><owl:Class rdf:about="http://w3id.org/mmho#ArtifactAssemblage"><rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/mmho#FinalProducts"/><rdfs:label xml:lang="zh">器物组合件</rdfs:label><rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Artifact Assemblage</rdfs:label><rdfs:comment xml:lang="zh">考古出土场景中由多个独立器物组合而成的器物群。典型实例如编钟、车马器组合、酒器组合等。本类用于建模器物组合件这一**类型概念**（TBox），具体某一组（如"曾侯乙编钟组合"）应在 ABox 数据填充时作为本类的实例（NamedIndividual）建模，并通过 mmho:consistsOfComponent 属性关联其组件。</rdfs:comment></owl:Class></rdf:RDF><!-- Generated by the OWL API (version 4.5.29.2024-05-13T12:11:03Z) https://github.com/owlcs/owlapi -->
